# VBMOUSE.DRV — Windows 3.x absolute mouse driver for DOSBox-X integration
# Source: https://depot.javispedro.com/vbox/vbados/vbados.zip (VBMOUSE.DRV)
# Project: https://git.javispedro.com/cgit/vbados.git/about/
# License: GPLv2 (see https://git.javispedro.com/cgit/vbados.git/plain/COPYING)
# This file is the Windows 3.x absolute mouse driver (VBMOUSE.DRV) from the
# vbados project. It works with DOSBox-X's built-in absolute int33 mouse
# API extension, providing 1:1 touch-to-cursor mapping in Windows 3.x.
# (VBMOUSE.EXE TSR is NOT required — DOSBox-X provides absolute int33 events.)